Install the repo sync timer after the updated files are in /opt/k8s-ansible:

cd /opt/k8s-ansible
bash scripts/install-repo-sync-timer.sh

Defaults:
- REPO_DIR=/opt/k8s-ansible
- REPO_URL=https://github.com/psi1703/k8s-ansible.git
- BRANCH=main
- SYNC_INTERVAL=1min
- RUN_AFTER_SYNC=0

The timer only syncs the repo. It does not run setup.sh or deploy.

Manual sync:

sudo systemctl start k8s-ansible-repo-sync.service

Watch logs:

sudo tail -f /var/log/k8s-ansible/repo-sync.log

Change polling interval example:

SYNC_INTERVAL=5min bash scripts/install-repo-sync-timer.sh
